# X6855 uses an AWINIC RichTap / AW8697 haptic amplifier on i2c
# (haptic_hv@5A). The driver defers its haptic_ram.bin load for ~8 s after
# probe; trigger the RAM firmware load as soon as boot completes so the
# vibrator is ready before the first touch.
on property:sys.boot_completed=1
    write /sys/class/leds/vibrator_single/ram_update 1
